# Translations of the 3D city (city3d.html + city3d*.js) — 18.11.2026, owner «Переведи 3д город для всех наших клиентов, на все языки».
# Row = (ru, en, es, pt, fr, de, ja, ko, zh). The key is the exact Russian text in the code: _t('русский текст', {vars}).
# {n}, {x}… are filled in by the code — keep them; <b>…</b> stays as it is.
# Build:  python3 tools/i18n_city3d.py   → writes city3d-i18n.js (only the city's texts; the app's big i18n.js is not loaded in the city).
# Names of the city's gear (HERO.GEAR) are taken from the app's i18n.js (REUSE below) — one translation for the wardrobe and the city.
# Terms: crew = банда (ja クルー, ko 크루, zh 帮派), respect ★ = уважение (ja リスペクト, ko 리스펙트, zh 声望), energy ⚡ (zh 能量),
# crash = срыв (es caída, pt queda, fr chute, de Sturz, ja ミス, ko 실수, zh 失误), districts: Двор = The Yard, Центр = Downtown,
# Парк = the Park, Промзона = the Industrial Zone, Клуб = the Club. Toprock/footwork are DANCED, only power moves are SPUN.
ROWS = []
def t(*r):
    assert len(r) == 9, r[0]
    ROWS.append(r)

